00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.912
Step 4.

00:00:01.862 --> 00:00:04.237
The lobbying forensics.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:15.950
CIJA lobbied 56 percent of sitting MPs. Brookfield entities filed 120 registered communications with the federal government between 2018 and 2024.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:26.862
NorthRiver Midstream — a Brookfield subsidiary — surged 375 percent in lobbying contacts in 2023, the same year the Maple Fund was pitched.
